Hasklig bitmap fonts
====================

hasklig.romfont holds hasklig.font in the sizes 8, 11 and 13: bitmap
conversions of Hasklig Regular, a character to a cell, for the characters
32 to 255 of ISO 8859-1. The kernel keeps them in memory beside topaz.
Bitmap fonts have no ligatures, so those of Hasklig are left out.

Source:  https://github.com/i-tu/Hasklig
Version: 1.2 (TTF/Hasklig-Regular.ttf of Hasklig-1.2.zip)
Licence: SIL Open Font License 1.1, see LICENSE

tools/mkfont.py makes hasklig.romfont from Hasklig-Regular.ttf:

    tools/mkfont.py Hasklig-Regular.ttf
